<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 185.34 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tue.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 185.34 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 185.34 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Tuesday after buying 1.052 billion rand's worth on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
